  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href='http://www.gpo.gov'>www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mrs. BLACKBURN:\nH.R. 4070.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8, Clause 3 protecting interstate\ncommerce across the Internet. Additionally, we cite Clause 14\nof Section 8 to make rules for the federal government.\n[Page H1880]\n</pre>",
